construct, namely the "^":

	fld ~ '^[A-F]' -- STARTS with A,B,C,D,E, or F
	fld ~ '[A-F]'  -- merely contains A,B,C,D,E, or F
	fld ~ '[A-F]$' -- ENDS with A-F

